{"4859540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Word Puzzle Master","steam_appid":4859540,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4905330,4905340,4905350,4905360],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word Puzzle Master is a cozy word game built around one simple pleasure: spotting words hidden in a grid of letters. Drag across neighbouring tiles to spell a word, watch the letters lift into place, and clear the board one word at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time — you can't lose a level here. When there's a clock at all, it only decides your third star, never the game. Just letters, soft light, and the quiet satisfaction of a board coming clean.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT'S INSIDE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 10 themed packs — Body, City, Nature, Space, Music, History and more, each with its own words.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Boards that grow with you — from quick 3×3 grids up to 5×5, capped by a 7×7 BOSS in every pack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five ways to play:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Category: clear the levels, earn up to three stars on each.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Daily Puzzle: one new board every day — keep your streak alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Endless: clear board after board until the words run out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Time Attack: how many words can you find in 1, 3 or 5 minutes?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Hardcore: no hints. Just you and the grid.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hints when you need them, plus a free handful every day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Steam Achievements to collect.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully offline, single-player, and friendly for all ages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a category, trace your first word, and see how far you get.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A note on languages: the interface is fully translated into English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish and German. The puzzle words themselves are in English for now — more language packs are on the way.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word Puzzle Master is a cozy word game built around one simple pleasure: spotting words hidden in a grid of letters. Drag across neighbouring tiles to spell a word, watch the letters lift into place, and clear the board one word at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time — you can't lose a level here. When there's a clock at all, it only decides your third star, never the game. Just letters, soft light, and the quiet satisfaction of a board coming clean.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHAT'S INSIDE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 10 themed packs — Body, City, Nature, Space, Music, History and more, each with its own words.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Boards that grow with you — from quick 3×3 grids up to 5×5, capped by a 7×7 BOSS in every pack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Five ways to play:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Category: clear the levels, earn up to three stars on each.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Daily Puzzle: one new board every day — keep your streak alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Endless: clear board after board until the words run out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Time Attack: how many words can you find in 1, 3 or 5 minutes?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   – Hardcore: no hints. Just you and the grid.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hints when you need them, plus a free handful every day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Steam Achievements to collect.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully offline, single-player, and friendly for all ages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a category, trace your first word, and see how far you get.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A note on languages: the interface is fully translated into English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish and German. The puzzle words themselves are in English for now — more language packs are on the way.<\/p>","short_description":"A cozy word puzzle. Trace neighbouring letters to spell hidden words and clear the grid — calm, unhurried and impossible to lose. Themed packs, daily puzzles, endless and time-attack modes, and three stars to chase on every level.","supported_languages":"영어, 독일어, 스페인어 - 스페인, 중국어 간체, 러시아어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4859540\/4f547ac3de5a9cf83321673e5507bc33d650bf0e\/header.jpg?t=1784270616","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4859540\/67f229359242ea4b6bdb6d36d68116b4cdf31cdf\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784270616","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4859540\/67f229359242ea4b6bdb6d36d68116b4cdf31cdf\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784270616","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz (Intel Core i3 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 11<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 500 MB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU or Intel UHD 620+<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 11<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 1 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Tilewise"],"publishers":["Tilewise"],"price_overview":{"currency":"KRW","initial":275000,"final":275000,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"₩ 2,750"},"packages":[1687805],"package_groups":[{"name":